          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಂಶೋಧನೆ — saṃśōdhane — \"research\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅವಳು ಕಾಡಿನ ಹಕ್ಕಿಗಳ ಬಗ್ಗೆ ಸಂಶೋಧನೆ ಮಾಡುತ್ತಾಳೆ. avaḷu kāḍina hakkigaḷa bagge saṃśōdhane māḍuttāḷe. She does research on forest birds."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಂಶೋಧಕ, a researcher."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಂಶೋಧನೆ (saṃśōdhane) is borrowed from Sanskrit saṃśodhana, \"completely purifying, correcting\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
